 python3,
 llama.cpp-tools-spacemit,
Description: Bibit voice wake-word, VAD, and ASR service
 Headless voice pipeline exposing a JSON-lines Unix socket protocol for wake
 word detection, voice activity detection, and speech recognition (SenseVoice
 or Qwen3-ASR) over PipeWire. This package ships the service, tool proxy, and
 protocol documentation only; no socket client UI is included.

Package: libsherpa-onnx-c-api
Architecture: any
Depends:
 ${shlibs:Depends},
 ${misc:Depends},
 spacemit-onnxruntime,
Description: sherpa-onnx C API runtime for SpacemiT riscv64
 Runtime shared library for the sherpa-onnx C API, built for SpacemiT K3
 riscv64. It depends on the SpacemiT onnxruntime engine and execution
 provider (spacemit-onnxruntime).
